LIGGGHTS (Version LIGGGHTS-PUBLIC 3.8.0, compiled 2026-03-26-14:37:06 by yonghoon, git commit 3d5c00f20519e6bb6eb6756f51f1ad36564e649d)
# kg50_d07_b50 RESTART (r56) — after_settling 체크포인트에서 이어받음
#   read_restart : restart_kg50_d07_b50/restart_after_settling.bin
#   step         : after_settling

# ===== SE 입도 비교 생성본 (make_se_size_decks.py · 50kg/batch 4차년도) =====
#   kg50_d07_b50: mono AM D6, AM:SE=85:15 wt%, SE D50 0.7um, 6.5mAh/cm2, 50x50um
#   기준 덱 = phase_a 6 mAh 템플릿 (docs/data/phase_a_6mah/ · sha256 900ae9c8f1fde02e83ac86dcee7cca55a10df9ac73e59f15a1ae1516903bfda7 · 파일 경로 = manifest.json "template") — 바꾼 자리 = 아래뿐
#   ① 조성 단일 활물질 (AM_P 자리 · pts2 정의만) · 질량분율 AM 0.85 · SE 0.15
#   ② r_AM_P 3 µm · r_SE 0.35 µm   ③ 진밀도 세대 lab20261014: AM 4.85 · SE 1.64 g/cm³
#   ④ 영역 50×50 µm (reg_box · reg_mix · 판 꼭짓점 · 압력 면적 0.0025)
#   ⑤ 삽입 위끝 z 0.322700 (높이 317.7 µm · volumefraction 0.321 그대로) = 고체 두께 101.98 µm = 6.5 mAh/cm² @ 200 mAh/g
#   ⑥ 시드 (큰 소수 · 케이스마다 독립): 15500011, 15600001, 15700019, 15800017, 15900013
#   ⑦ 태그 = 기준 덱의 케이스 태그 (소문자 24 곳 · 대문자 2 곳) → kg50_d07_b50 · KG50_D07_B50   ⑧ maxattempt 15,000 → 3,000 (예상 488,291 × 3,000 = 1.46e+09 < 2^31/1.3 · 원장 PS-01)
#   ⑨ processors * * 1 (x·y 분할)   ⑩ 삽입 자기검사 (99 %)   ⑪ restart 200000 restart_kg50_d07_b50/restart_compress_*.bin (간격 200,000)
#   ⑫ atom 덤프 간격 5,000 → 50,000
#   ⑬ 삽입 직후 체크포인트 없음 (첫 체크포인트 = step 50,000)
#   ⑭ 삽입 직후 정수 구간 — AM 1474–1488 (계획 1,481) · SE 484376–489244 (계획 486,810) 밖이면 quit 1 — 삽입은 NP 1
#   ⑯ 끝 상태 = 최종 restart_end · atom · contact · mesh 한 장씩 (run 0) · 이완 중 체크포인트 끔 (restart 0)
#   ⑬ (D0.7 · D1 · D2) 삽입 전용 덱 = 이 덱의 정착 run 앞까지 그대로 + run 20000 + write_restart restart_settling_20001 + run 3000 (NP 1)
#   ⑮ 이웃 skin 그대로 (2 µm)
#   그대로: 재료 property/global 전부 (E_SE 0.135e7 = 1.35 GPa 연화값) · 접촉법칙 · dt · 이웃 · 벽 · 중력 · 감쇠 ·
#     정착 200,000 · 안정화 200,000 · 판 속도 0.01 · 목표 0.30 (300 MPa) · 이완 100,000 · 접촉 · mesh 덤프
#   예상 입자 수 (질량분율 규약): AM_P 1,481 · SE 486,810 (합 488,291) · 예상 면용량 6.499 mAh/cm²
#   ⚠ 상별 수는 MPI 랭크 · 시드에 따라 흔들린다 (부족 또는 초과 · SELF-70 · KG50-07) — 삽입은 NP 1 · 런 뒤 덤프로 실현 조성을 센다.
#   ⚠ 감쇠 fix damp all viscous 0.5 = 모든 입자에 같은 γ — γ/m 이 SE 크기에 따라 다르다 (D0.7 ↔ D3 ≈ 79 배 · KG50-04 · 대조 = 등록 뒤).
#   ⚠ 언로딩 없음 — 끝 상태 = 판 고정 이완 (가압 상태) · 실험 (하중 제거) 과 바로 비교하지 않는다.

# ============================================================
# kg50_d07_b50: SE 입도 비교 (50kg/batch 4차년도 · make_se_size_decks.py)
# Scale: r×1000, E×0.001, P×0.001
# ============================================================

# --- 1. General Settings ---
atom_style      granular
atom_modify     map array sort 0 0
boundary        p p f
newton          off
soft_particles  yes
communicate     single vel yes
units           si

# --- 2. Variables & Domain ---
variable target_press equal 0.30          # 300 MPa × 0.001
variable r_AM_P  equal 3e-3            # AM_P r=3μm → Sim 3mm
variable r_AM_S  equal 2.0e-3            # AM_S r=2μm → Sim 2mm
variable r_SE    equal 0.35e-3            # SE r=0.35μm → Sim 0.35mm
variable dt      equal 1.0e-6
variable plate_margin equal 0.003
timestep        ${dt}
timestep        1e-06

# RVE: 50×50 μm → Sim 0.05×0.05 m
processors * * 1

read_restart    restart_kg50_d07_b50/restart_after_settling.bin
  orthogonal box = (0 0 -0.01) to (0.05 0.05 1)
  8 by 7 by 1 MPI processor grid
  488285 atoms
fix pts1 all particletemplate/sphere 15500011 atom_type 1 density constant 4850 radius constant ${r_AM_P}
fix pts1 all particletemplate/sphere 15500011 atom_type 1 density constant 4850 radius constant 0.003
Resetting global state of Fix pts1 Style particletemplate/sphere from restart file info
fix pts2 all particletemplate/sphere 15600001 atom_type 2 density constant 4850 radius constant ${r_AM_S}   # (이 케이스 질량분율 0 — 분포에서 제외)
fix pts2 all particletemplate/sphere 15600001 atom_type 2 density constant 4850 radius constant 0.002   
Resetting global state of Fix pts2 Style particletemplate/sphere from restart file info
fix pts3 all particletemplate/sphere 15700019 atom_type 3 density constant 1640 radius constant ${r_SE}
fix pts3 all particletemplate/sphere 15700019 atom_type 3 density constant 1640 radius constant 0.00035
Resetting global state of Fix pts3 Style particletemplate/sphere from restart file info
fix pdd_mix all particledistribution/discrete 15800017 2 pts1 0.85 pts3 0.15
Resetting global state of Fix pdd_mix Style particledistribution/discrete from restart file info

neighbor        0.002 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 check yes

# --- 3. Material Properties (Type 1:AM_P, 2:AM_S, 3:SE) ---
# AM: E=140 GPa → Sim 1.4e8 Pa, ν=0.25
# SE: E=1.35 GPa → Sim 0.135e7 Pa (소성변형 보정), ν=0.30
fix m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 1.4e8 1.4e8 0.135e7
fix m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.25 0.25 0.30

fix m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 3     0.3 0.3 0.3     0.3 0.3 0.3     0.3 0.3 0.3

fix m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 3     0.5 0.5 0.5     0.5 0.5 0.5     0.5 0.5 0.5

fix m5 all property/global coefficientRollingFriction peratomtypepair 3     0.2 0.2 0.1     0.2 0.2 0.1     0.1 0.1 0.1

fix m6 all property/global coefficientMaxElasticStiffness peratomtypepair 3     1.5 1.5 3.0     1.5 1.5 3.0     3.0 3.0 5.0

fix m7 all property/global coefficientAdhesionStiffness peratomtypepair 3     1.0e5 1.0e5 2.0e5     1.0e5 1.0e5 2.0e5     2.0e5 2.0e5 1.0e6

fix m8 all property/global coefficientPlasticityDepth peratomtypepair 3     0.05 0.05 0.01     0.05 0.05 0.01     0.01 0.01 0.005

fix m9 all property/global characteristicVelocity scalar 2.0

# --- 4. Contact Model ---
pair_style      gran model hooke/hysteresis tangential history rolling_friction cdt
pair_coeff      * *

compute strs all stress/atom
compute ke   all ke/atom
compute cpl all pair/gran/local pos id force force_normal force_tangential torque contactArea delta contactPoint

# --- 5. Wall (Bottom) ---
fix zwall_bot all wall/gran model hooke/hysteresis tangential history rolling_friction cdt primitive type 1 zplane 0.0
Resetting global state of Fix history_zwall_bot Style property/atom from restart file info
Resetting per-atom state of Fix history_zwall_bot Style property/atom from restart file info

# --- 6. Templates & Distribution ---
# Type 1: AM   (NCM811, ρ=4850 kg/m³, r=3μm) — 단일 활물질
# Type 2: AM_S (정의만 · 분포 가중 0 · ρ=4850 kg/m³)
# Type 3: SE   (LPSCl,  ρ=1640 kg/m³, r=0.35μm)


# ── 삽입 자기검사 (원장 `PS-01` · 감사 GAP high) ──
#   부분 삽입 침대는 조성이 달라 **다른 물건**이다 — 완주시키지 않는다.
variable n_ins equal count(all)
print "====== INSERTED ${n_ins} / 488291 (floor 483408 = 99%) ======"
====== INSERTED 488285 / 488291 (floor 483408 = 99%) ======
if "${n_ins} < 483408" then     "print 'FATAL: partial insertion - bed composition differs (PS-01). aborting.'"     "quit 1"

# ⑭ 삽입 직후 AM 수 — 계획 1,481 · 정수 구간 1474–1488 (±0.5 % 안 · ceil/floor) · 상별 수는 MPI 랭크 · 시드에 따라 흔들린다 (부족 또는 초과 · SELF-70 · KG50-07) → 삽입은 NP 1
group g_am_ins type 1
1481 atoms in group g_am_ins
variable n_am_ins equal count(g_am_ins)
print "====== AM ${n_am_ins} / 1481 (gate 1474-1488) ======"
====== AM 1481 / 1481 (gate 1474-1488) ======
if "${n_am_ins} < 1474 || ${n_am_ins} > 1488" then     "print 'FATAL: AM count off plan (SELF-70) - insert at NP 1. aborting.'"     "quit 1"

# ⑭ 삽입 직후 SE 수 — 계획 486,810 · 정수 구간 484376–489244 (±0.5 % 안 · ceil/floor) · 상별 수는 MPI 랭크 · 시드에 따라 흔들린다 (부족 또는 초과 · SELF-70 · KG50-07) → 삽입은 NP 1
group g_se_ins type 3
486804 atoms in group g_se_ins
variable n_se_ins equal count(g_se_ins)
print "====== SE ${n_se_ins} / 486810 (gate 484376-489244) ======"
====== SE 486804 / 486810 (gate 484376-489244) ======
if "${n_se_ins} < 484376 || ${n_se_ins} > 489244" then     "print 'FATAL: SE count off plan (SELF-70) - insert at NP 1. aborting.'"     "quit 1"

# --- 8. Output ---
shell mkdir -p post_kg50_d07_b50
thermo_style    custom step atoms ke cpu
thermo          1000

# --- 9. Phase 1: Settling ---
fix integr all nve/sphere
fix gravi all gravity 98.1 vector 0.0 0.0 -1.0
fix damp all viscous 1.0e-5
compute zmax all reduce max z
shell mkdir -p restart_kg50_d07_b50
restart 50000 restart_kg50_d07_b50/restart_settling_*.bin

print "====== RESTART SAVED ======"
====== RESTART SAVED ======
thermo_style    custom step atoms c_zmax
thermo          1
run 1
Resetting global state of Fix contacthistory Style contacthistory from restart file info
Resetting per-atom state of Fix contacthistory Style contacthistory from restart file info
